{"parse":{"title":"Gales of Reverie","pageid":187686,"revid":1850186,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Gales of Reverie</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/4f/Talent_Gales_of_Reverie.png/revision/latest?cb=20221207030103\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Gales of Reverie\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/4f/Talent_Gales_of_Reverie.png/revision/latest?cb=20221207030103\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/4f/Talent_Gales_of_Reverie.png/revision/latest?cb=20221207030103 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/4/4f/Talent_Gales_of_Reverie.png/revision/latest?cb=20221207030103 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Gales of Reverie\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Gales_of_Reverie.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Gales of Reverie.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wanderer\" title=\"Wanderer\">Wanderer</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/4th_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"4th Ascension Passive\">4th Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When the Wanderer hits opponents with Kuugo: Fushoudan or Kuugo: Toufukai in his Windfavored state, he has a 16% chance to obtain the Descent effect: The next time the Wanderer accelerates in mid-air while in this instance of the Windfavored state, this effect will be removed, this acceleration instance will not consume any Kuugoryoku Points, and he will fire off 4 wind arrows that deal 35% of his ATK as <span class=\"text-anemo\"><b>Anemo DMG</b></span> each.<br />For each Kuugo: Fushoudan and Kuugo: Toufukai that does not produce this effect, the next attack of those types will have a 12% increased chance of producing it. The calculation of the effect production is done once every 0.1s.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"scale_att1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Scaling</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/ATK\" title=\"ATK\">ATK</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Gales of Reverie</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Wanderer\" title=\"Wanderer\">Wanderer</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/4th_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"4th Ascension Passive\">4th Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Advanced_Properties\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Advanced Properties</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGales_of_Reverie%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>When Wanderer obtains the Descent effect, an emblem will appear over him accompanied by a sound cue. While he remains in the Descent effect state he will have winds swirling around his wrists.</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><big>Constellation Effects</big></dt></dl>\n<ul><li>Constellation Level 1, <span class=\"item constellation\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shoban:_Ostentatious_Plumage\" title=\"Shoban: Ostentatious Plumage\"><img alt=\"Shoban: Ostentatious Plumage\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Shoban Ostentatious Plumage.png\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Shoban_Ostentatious_Plumage.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c9/Constellation_Shoban_Ostentatious_Plumage.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20221207030137\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shoban:_Ostentatious_Plumage\" title=\"Shoban: Ostentatious Plumage\"><img alt=\"Shoban: Ostentatious Plumage\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Shoban Ostentatious Plumage.png\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Shoban_Ostentatious_Plumage.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c9/Constellation_Shoban_Ostentatious_Plumage.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20221207030137\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Shoban:_Ostentatious_Plumage\" title=\"Shoban: Ostentatious Plumage\">Shoban: Ostentatious Plumage</a></span></span>: \"When in the Windfavored state, the Attack SPD of the Wanderer's Kuugo: Fushoudan and Kuugo: Toufukai is increased by 10%. Additionally, the wind arrows fired by the Ascension Talent &#39;<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Gales of Reverie</strong>&#39; will deal an additional 25% of his ATK as DMG. You must first unlock the Ascension Talent &#39;Gales of Reverie.&#39;\"</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Advanced_Properties\">Advanced Properties</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGales_of_Reverie%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable thc tdl\" style=\"min-width:600px\">\n<tbody><tr><th rowspan=\"2\"></th><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Gauge_Theory\" title=\"Elemental Gauge Theory\">Gauge<br />Units</a></th><th colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Internal_Cooldown\" title=\"Internal Cooldown\">Internal Cooldown</a></th><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Interruption_Resistance\" title=\"Interruption Resistance\">Poise<br />Damage</a></th><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/Interruption_Resistance/Stagger\" title=\"Interruption Resistance/Stagger\">Stagger Effect</a></th><th rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blunt_Attack\" title=\"Blunt Attack\">Blunt</a></th></tr><tr><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Tag\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Tag</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Attacks with the same ICD Tag and the same ICD Type will share ICD.</span></span>&#8205;</th><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"Type\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">Type</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Attacks with the same ICD Tag and the same ICD Type will share ICD.</span></span>&#8205;</th><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"S. L.\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">S. L.</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Stagger Level</span></span>&#8205;</th><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"H. F.\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">H. F.</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Horizontal Force</span></span>&#8205;</th><th>&#8205;<span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\" data-tt-text=\"V. F.\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed custom-tt toggle-tooltip\">V. F.</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content custom-tt\" style=\"display:none\">Vertical Force</span></span>&#8205;</th></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:left\">Wind Arrow</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">1U</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Wanderer Wind Arrow</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">1s</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">15</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Shake</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">0</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">0</td><td style=\"text-align:left\"><span class=\"check-no\" data-sort-value=\"3\" title=\"No\">&#10008;</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FGales_of_Reverie%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"a71126fad4ef3d73c426cdef6f62d2c6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\